## Technical corrections
15. §1/§3.2 MAJOR: 5.0 -timedemo is NOT uncapped: singletics (d_main.cpp:518) is never set true; G_TimeDemo (g_game.cpp:3037-3045) only sets nodrawers/noblit/timingdemo; tics paced by I_GetTime. "tics_per_sec_under_load in a -timedemo run" was unmeasurable above 35. Added harness fix: under timingdemo force doWait=false (2200-2208), totalTics=1 before NetUpdate (2221), singletics=true; explained why each is needed. Added i_timescale (d_main.cpp:405-417) as unverified alternative (Open risk). Render runs switched to -playdemo.
16. §3.2 S2 tics/s "≈ 3.4 (3.4 fps with ≤ 1 tic per frame)" -> ≈6 (Inference: think 249.88/frame ÷ ≈145 ms/tic ≈ 1.7 tics/frame × 3.4 fps); "≤ 1 tic per frame" is not in [M].
17. §3.1 cpu_script_ms: source "vm_script_calls time (P1 §0.5)" (a count, not a time) -> stock VMCycles[0] (vmframe.cpp:732-736, 351-353; stat vm 895-911); noted it is not identical to [M]'s governor-attributed script ms.
18. §3.1 tris_rendered: added API facts (pipelineStatisticsQuery feature; multiview queries use N indices, distribution implementation-dependent, only sum defined).
19. §3.3 missed frames: compare against nominal refresh, not current predictedDisplayPeriod (runtime half-rate throttling doubles the period and hides misses); SteamVR GetFrameTiming is OpenVR -> Open risk; pose-to-photon needs XrTime conversion extensions.
20. §5.1 hash: StaticSumSeeds covers 4 RNGs only -> walk FRandom::RNGList (m_random.h:218); actors hashed in SpawnOrder (actor.h:1408) not list order (dormancy/throttled statnums move actors between lists); added special/args, polyobjects, line specials.
21. §5.3 head-shake: reference pass must not feed Hi-Z/temporal state; depth epsilon + invariant gl_Position requirement; depth-only diff misses translucent/portal interiors -> colour diff too.
22. §2 S8: fake-pose provider is engine-side (OpenXR has no pose injection); comfort not judgeable; Monado alternative as Open risk.

